sequenceDiagram
  participant O as اپراتور
  participant P as primary
  participant BE as ScrubBackend
  participant R as replica خراب
  O->>P: ceph pg repair 2.1f
  P->>P: operator_forced: urgency = must_repair
  P->>BE: deep scrub همه‌ی chunkها
  BE->>BE: select_auth_object ⇒ shard سالم
  BE->>P: repair_object(soid, ok_peer, bad_peers) ⇒ force_object_missing
  P->>P: افزودن به missing و missing_loc فقط با منبع سالم
  P->>R: push از روی نسخه‌ی authoritative
  R-->>P: PushReply
  P->>P: علامت repaired، به‌روزرسانی stats
